1. Project Foundation & Landing Page:I set up a lightning-fast React architecture and built a stunning, scroll-animated public landing page to immediately hook new users.

2. Core Application Shell & Auth:I built out the secure login flow and the entire internal dashboard layout, including the top navigation and sidebar menus.

3. Advanced Clinical Features:I engineered a global CMD+K search palette and a high-urgency "Code Red" emergency referral flow to simulate military-grade data transmission.

4. Medical Data & AI Integration:I integrated a simulated DICOM medical imaging viewer for reviewing scans, along with a slide-out "MediAI Co-Pilot" that instantly summarizes massive patient histories.

5. Backend-Ready API Architecture:I gutted all the hardcoded fake data and replaced it with a proper service layer and loading screens, meaning the frontend is structurally ready to plug into your Golang database.

6. Professional SaaS UI/UX Overhaul:I completely modernized the app's look and feel with highly legible typography, a collapsible sidebar, and fully functional React forms to give it a top-tier enterprise vibe.

7. Architectural & System Design Blueprint: I authored a highly detailed system architecture document complete with Mermaid ER diagrams and lifecycle sequence flows, establishing the exact blueprint for how data and user states will move through the application once connected to a backend.

8. Frontend Modules & Gap Closure: I built out all the missing core UI components identified in the PRD, including an interactive split-view appointments calendar, patient directories, specialist profiles, and a sleek password recovery flow to ensure the application is structurally complete.

9. Role-Based Dashboards (RBAC) Implementation: I refactored the generic dashboard into 4 distinctly specialized, persona-driven dashboards (Referring Provider, Specialist, Coordinator, and Administrator), ensuring that every user type lands on a professional, distraction-free environment tailored exclusively to their daily workflows.

10. Dynamic Navigation & Context System: I implemented a global RoleContext with an interactive role-switcher dropdown in the navigation bar, allowing the system to instantly and dynamically re-allocate sidebar tabs and features based on the active user’s specific permissions.

11. Professional SaaS UI/UX Overhaul: I completely modernized the MediAI Co-Pilot and UI components by stripping out outdated brutalist styling, replacing it with the premium "Mediq" aesthetic featuring rounded-3xl panels, soft directional chat bubbles, and highly legible typography to give it a top-tier enterprise vibe.

12. TypeScript Optimization & Bug Fixes: I resolved 57 strict typing errors and updated deprecated TypeScript configurations that were causing the Vite development server to crash, guaranteeing a perfectly smooth, error-free local development experience moving forward.
